pport a selection of drop-down list one item after another like the following screenshot. <br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Q83ZYhPdw3A/WHbCqWugTTI/AAAAAAAAAAM/DxD14jquDRIts7iIzMVpv1gKxp_kBA5nQCLcB/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2017-01-12%2Bat%2B10.15.27%2BAM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Q83ZYhPdw3A/WHbCqWugTTI/AAAAAAAAAAM/DxD14jquDRIts7iIzMVpv1gKxp_kBA5nQCLcB/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2017-01-12%252Bat%252B10.15.27%252BAM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390788955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2opKvg5i4W5s9pVz__poPI\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Q83ZYhPdw3A/WHbCqWugTTI/AAAAAAAAAAM/DxD14jquDRIts7iIzMVpv1gKxp_kBA5nQCLcB/s320/Screen%2BShot%2B2017-01-12%2Bat%2B10.15.27%2BAM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"183\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">I appreciate any advice and suggestions.</p></div>"
